{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21367","headline":"酬友封话旧叙怀十二韵 · 元稹","name":"酬友封话旧叙怀十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风波千里别，书信二年稀。\n乍见悲兼喜，犹惊是与非。\n身名判作梦，盃盏莫相违。\n草馆同牀宿，沙头待月归。\n春深乡路远，老去宦情微。\n魏阙何由到，荆州且共依。\n人欺翻省事，官冷易藏威。\n但拟驯鸥鸟，无因用弩机。\n开张图卷轴，颠倒醉衫衣。\n蓴菜银丝嫩，鲈鱼雪片肥。\n怜君诗似涌，赠我笔如飞。\n会遣诸伶唱，篇篇入禁闱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}